OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering rain in the south will
OL,7,Fgradually clear through the evening to
OL,8,Fleave a dry night with plenty of clear
OL,9,Fspells. Winds becoming light and
OL,10,Fturning rather cool.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA chilly start to Friday,
OL,13,Fleading to a drier and brighter day
OL,14,Fwith plenty of sunny spells, although
OL,15,Fwith a risk of showers. Feeling
OL,16,Fnoticeably cooler in the northwesterly
OL,17,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
