OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells through the
OL,7,Fweekend and into Monday. Chilly nights
OL,8,Fbring a risk of frost and patchy fog.
OL,9,FBreezier later especially across
OL,10,Fwestern coasts and hills.
